{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601230","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1460123001:1":{"text":"그레이브본을 빨리 초대하기 위해서 우리는 신밧드와 보르스가 준비한 즐거운 식사 자리를 거절할 수밖에 없었다.","source_cn":"为了尽早达成邀请，你们不得不忍痛拒绝了辛巴达和波尔斯的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F323B6C794CFCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1460123002:0":{"text":"시더 마을에 도착한 우리는 곧장 라지노프 장원 유적지로 향했다...","source_cn":"动身前往雪松镇，直奔拉季诺夫庄园的遗址……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCD62AC2F55843C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460123003:0":{"text":"마침 그곳에서 캐롤라이나와 카렌이 손님을 맞이하고 있었다...","source_cn":"很巧的是，卡列琳娜和铐兰也正在招待着客人们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93CC55DC0F155546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460123004:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 여긴 무슨 일이세요? 새로운 손님도 있으시네요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6268830E273B0803","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 여긴 무슨 일이세요? 새로운 손님도 있으시네요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 여긴 무슨 일이세요? 새로운 손님도 있으시네요.","variant_male_record_index":"168333","variant_female_record_index":"168334","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460123005:0":{"