ariant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1460123015:1":{"text":"그렇다면 직접 대회 예선을 주관하면서 홍보하는 건, 네 소원을 이룰 수 있는 방법일 것 같구나.","source_cn":"而亲自组织、宣传并负责一场大赛的预选赛，我想，更能推进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0616AF98DCF2B944","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1460123016:1":{"text":"캐롤라이나는 너처럼 조용한 걸 좋아하고 사람들과 어울리는 걸 꺼려하잖아.","source_cn":"卡列琳娜和你一样，喜欢安静，也不爱和人打交道，还是算了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5C66CA4D4A6236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1460123017:1":{"text":"역시 내가...","source_cn":"我来负责就好——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE75F093A7B5A9957","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1460123018:1":{"text":"아니, 발리카 언니. 마음은 고맙지만 내가 해보고 싶어.","source_cn":"不，瓦丽卡姐姐，我明白你的好意，但我想来试试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1D302B24959B7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1460123019:1":{"text":"방금 말했던 것처럼 일단 우리가 먼저 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님과 겨뤄보자.","source_cn":"就像刚刚说的那样，先由我们联手与<style=stre...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x327BD7602AE0F6D5","variant_status":